les\" (2 points) to reach the 8-point threshold. It also reduces non-W tiles if I later shift to a Full Flush. Additionally, B4 appears relatively safe based on discard history (across player has already melded a B4-5-6 chow and discarded B4, reducing the chance others need it).\n\nAnswer: Play B4"}
